      "placement": {
        "tier": "release",
        "defaultTier": "release",
        "reason": ".github/workflows/deploy.yml ships main to production on its own schedule (03:47 UTC) and workflow_dispatch, and that trigger is the release event. The contract declares a critical behavior and the grade decides whether a learner passes a course (docs/DEPLOYING.md), so the release run blocks."
      }
